WEBVTT

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:01.950
Xyz Summon!

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:07.370
Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.940
Th-This is... Can it be...

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:15.590
Yes! It's me, Kaito!

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.130
Seeing my ace monster, Dark Rebellion 
Xyz Dragon, you must remember...

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:26.590
You can't have forgotten all those 
times you fought Syun and me,

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:28.270
back at the duel academy!

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:30.240
Are you...

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.510
Can you be... Ute?

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:36.860
That's Yuya.

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:40.650
He's with me.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:43.120
Syun?

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:44.780
That's right, Kaito.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:47.850
Syun returned with new allies.

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:49.790
Three of them.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:53.600
Even one would be valuable, 
so it's nice to see.

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.010
Kaito, come back with us.

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:58.520
And fight with us again—

00:00:58.520 --> 00:00:59.300
No!

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:02.540
I already severed my ties to you!

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:26.000
Kaito...

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:29.300
The Aquaria Project.

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:35.070
In their plan to create an ideal world, 
the Fusion Dimension's Academia

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:40.320
has driven Heartland City, in the Xyz 
Dimension, to the brink of obliteration.

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:18.980
The Spectacular Cyber Angels

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:44.760
We're here. This is our base.

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:53.980
Now, let's have some introductions.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.030
I'm Allen Kozuki.

00:03:56.030 --> 00:04:00.940
The one distributing soup rations 
is Sayaka Sasayama.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.810
We're part of the Resistance.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.420
Hey, Sayaka!

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:08.860
You aren't on duty today, so stop 
volunteering all your time away!

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:11.830
I know, but...

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:15.870
If you work yourself to death helping 
others, there's no point.

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:19.980
We don't know how long our fight 
with Academia will go on.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:23.310
I'm always telling you to take 
better care of yourself.

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:26.780
Yes, I know. Here, take this.

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:30.240
Sorry. She's afraid of strangers.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.480
It isn't like she hates you or anything.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.610
But you're quite friendly, I see...

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:39.730
We only just met, but you're already 
acting as if you're my equal.

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:40.460
Hey!

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:43.670
Those people...

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:46.670
They told us where you were.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:50.760
They were grateful for showing them

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:55.340
the true meaning of a duel, in your 
fight with the Academia solders.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:05:00.550
But I wasn't able to open 
Kaito's heart with the duel.

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:05.070
When I brought out Dark 
Rebellion, Ute's monster,

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:07.630
Kaito's heart definitely wavered.

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:12.120
But all I could feel was his 
anger toward Academia.

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:14.870
Yuya, was it?

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:18.560
Man, you really look like him.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:21.770
I was sure we had Ute back...

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:25.290
Who's Ute?

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:27.850
Yuzu mentioned him.

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:31.710
A boy Yuzu's met several times, 
who looks just like Yuya.

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:33.680
Why do you look so much alike?

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:35.910
How should I know?

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:39.950
Can it be... Are you actually Ute?

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:41.890
You did use Dark Rebellion!

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:44.090
No, I...

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:46.290
You should have said so earlier, then.

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:47.490
He isn't Ute.

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:53.670
He looks like him, but he's Yuya Sakaki.

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:55.320
Sakaki...

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.740
Then, where's Ute?

00:05:57.740 --> 00:06:01.040
He went to the Standard 
Dimension after you, Syun.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.840
Why didn't he come back with you?

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.920
Well, Ute is...

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:05.840
Don't.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.930
If you tell them, they won't understand.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:10.610
That I'm still alive inside of you.

00:06:10.610 --> 00:06:11.510
But...

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:16.350
It's true that Ute came to the Standard 
Dimension after me.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:19.430
But then he suddenly disappeared.

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:24.320
I suspected Yuya.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:28.330
I thought he attacked Ute and 
stole Dark Rebellion.

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:31.400
I also don't know what happened.

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:36.240
But Ute wants me to make 
people smile by dueling!

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.810
Make people smile by dueling?

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:42.650
That does seem like something Ute would say.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:47.350
I don't know where Ute is now.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:51.360
But since then, watching Yuya fight,

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:53.400
I've come to trust him.

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:54.530
For whatever reason,

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:59.420
I wouldn't be surprised if Ute 
entrusted his card to Yuya.

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:00.540
Kurosaki...

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:01.500
Syun...

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:06.700
I see. So that's how you ended 
up working together?

00:07:07.270 --> 00:07:09.770
I'm glad to hear it,

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:13.180
but things have gotten pretty bad 
while you've been gone.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:14.880
Bad?

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:19.580
Yeah, around the time when Syun and 
Ute went to the Standard Dimension,

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:23.050
the Academia Army's main force arrived.

00:07:23.050 --> 00:07:24.520
Main force?

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:34.250
The minute they saw someone, 
they turned their duel disks on them.

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:38.900
And made cards of them, without mercy.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:47.080
During that battle, the Resistance's 
Spade Branch was wiped out.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:51.280
Our Clover Branch almost was, too.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.490
With the few of us that remained,

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:57.780
we couldn't possibly protect the people.

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:05.130
We ran away in groups, barely managing 
to make a new base here.

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:11.640
How can this be?

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:14.560
If Ute and I had been here,

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:16.660
such a tragedy would have never happened.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:21.450
Did something happen to Kaito 
during that attack?

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:24.920
It wasn't Kaito. It was his family.

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:26.350
His family?

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:29.460
Yes. They got them all.

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:33.750
Kaito's family members were 
all taken by Academia.

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.200
They were turned into cards?

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:39.540
That's awful.

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:46.240
I still have so much to learn.

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:50.710
Jack taught me that a duel is a 
conversation between hearts.

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:54.150
And I was riding high, thinking I could 
make that happen again.

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:56.030
I will not communicate!

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:57.880
Academia must fall!

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:01.920
I was trying so hard to pry open Kaito's heart,

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:06.090
I couldn't see the sorrow 
that was lying deep inside.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:12.580
At this rate, I can't make Kaito... 
or any other hurt people, smile!

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:16.120
I can't face Jack or my father.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:20.580
Father? You said your 
name is Yuya Sakaki...

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.290
Yes, I am.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:27.350
Can it be... Do you have a connection 
to a man named "Yusyo Sakaki"?

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:31.320
You know Yusyo Sakaki? My father?!

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:34.520
Father? That's right, "Sakaki."

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:38.490
Are you really Yusyo Sakaki's son?

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:42.460
You two know my father?

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:47.150
I never expected to meet people who know 
Yuya's father in the Xyz Dimension.

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:48.630
Which means...

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:51.440
Huh? He's been here?

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:53.710
Yes, I know him.

00:09:53.710 --> 00:09:57.140
Yusyo Sakaki was our teacher.

00:09:57.390 --> 00:09:58.610
Teacher?

00:09:59.150 --> 00:10:05.340
He appeared three years ago, as if 
he knew Academia were coming.

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:08.650
And he taught us everything 
we know about duels.

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:10.860
Not just the techniques.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:14.140
But the spirit, never forgetting 
to smile at all times.

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:16.490
Three years ago?

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:20.030
But then, that means he wasn't a coward!

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:22.270
He wasn't running away.

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:24.700
He came across dimensions to fight Academia—

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:26.290
No, he is a coward.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:30.070
One day, he disappeared without warning.

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:32.680
He abandoned us and ran away!

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:45.720
Ow... Where am I?

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.460
What am I...

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:53.380
Is this... Maiami City?

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:57.660
No, it's some town I've never seen before.

00:10:58.280 --> 00:10:59.640
Just a little while ago, I...

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:01.740
Yuzu!

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:04.210
Yuya!

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:05.840
Yuzu!

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:07.860
Yuya...

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:14.750
I'm off!

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:16.390
Good luck!

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:18.400
Take care!

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:22.540
Listen to your teachers and study hard!

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:24.600
Become a great duelist!

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:27.870
They're all leaving to become duelists?

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.450
But why take a boat?

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:32.300
Why else? They're going to Academia.

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:34.040
Academia?

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:38.920
Yeah, Duel Academia's across the 
ocean, on an island.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:41.880
So you can only get there by boat...

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:45.020
That's common knowledge! 
You don't know that, lady?

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:47.830
Academia's across this ocean?

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:49.990
Then, this place is the...

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:53.270
Fusion Dimension?!

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:58.300
They're so lucky...

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:01.970
I hope I can graduate from elementary 
school and go to Academia soon.

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:04.760
If I can study there,

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:07.930
I can become a duelist strong 
enough to beat anyone!

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:09.500
Strong?

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.010
Don't you know what Academia is doing?

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:13.080
What?

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:18.010
Academia uses the duelists they 
train to attack other di—

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:19.680
Well, the ship's gone now.

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:21.210
We'd better go.

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:24.480
Work hard with your tutor,

00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:27.360
so you don't underachieve 
when you reach Academia.

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:29.810
Yeah! I'll do my best, Mama!

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.530
See you later, lady!

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.150
How old are you?

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:38.830
What? F-Fourteen...

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:41.970
At your age, you should be 
a student at Academia.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:43.820
What are you wearing?

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:45.310
What are you doing here?

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:47.450
Wh-Why?

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:49.900
You think she ran away from the island?

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:51.480
That does happen...

00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:54.150
Some people escape on the mail ship.

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:56.830
Hey, contact the truancy agents.

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.890
Tell them we have a runaway student.

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:01.860
What? You escaped?

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:04.560
Huh? No, I didn't escape.

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:07.080
Hey, right here!

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:10.190
If we let her go, it'll set a bad 
example for the others.

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:11.380
We'd better take her—

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:14.170
She's running! After her, fast!

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:15.040
Don't let her escape!

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:20.120
Of all places, I've been sent to 
Academia's Fusion Dimension?

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:26.660
Hold it!

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:33.800
Did you see her?

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:37.580
If I'm caught, I'll be sent to Academia.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.960
That's just what the Professor wants.

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:43.530
That way!

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:44.710
Wait!

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:52.660
Don't let her escape!

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:11.630
It won't open!

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:14.330
There's nowhere to run.

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:16.800
Return to the island peacefully!

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:21.410
If you aren't a repeat offender, you'll get 
off with one-month's detention.

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:25.340
But if you resist...

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:29.470
I'll just have to fight.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:30.510
Wait!

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:36.760
If you want to fight, fight me.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:44.760
U-Um...

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:47.230
Just stand back.

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:48.400
That woman is...

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:49.580
The one they mentioned?

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:51.580
Yeah, no question.

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.040
Don't lower your guard.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:55.440
She's taken out quite a few of us.

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:57.020
We'll face her simultaneously.

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:59.430
A battle royal?

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:01.380
Bring it on.

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:03.750
Who is this woman?

00:15:04.030 --> 00:15:04.890
Duel!

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.650
I'll go first.

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:11.520
I summon Etoile Cyber from my hand.

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:18.670
I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:21.200
My turn!

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:25.840
I summon Armor Canine — 
Cannonboxer from my hand!

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:33.310
And its monster effect lets 
me Special Summon

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:38.360
one Armor Canine of a level equal 
to or below that of Cannonboxer.

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:41.920
I Special Summon Armor 
Canine — Bullcopter!

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:50.240
When I successfully Special 
Summon Bullcopter,

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:53.260
I can add this card from my 
deck to my hand.

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:54.970
Fusion?

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:59.400
I activate the spell card 
Polymerization in my hand.

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:02.340
I fuse Cannonboxer and Bullcopter!

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:07.560
Hunting dog like a gun, become one 
with the fierce flying canine

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:10.700
and roar in the heavens, as a new power!

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:13.420
Fusion Summon!

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:14.890
Appear...

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:20.280
Full Armor Canine — Bullfortress!

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.660
Bullfortress's monster effect activates.

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:27.500
By sending a Polymerization 
card to the graveyard,

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:30.490
I increase its attack points by 1000.

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.900
Straight to 3000 attack points!

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:39.770
In a battle royal, no player can 
attack on the first turn.

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:42.630
That gives you a stay of execution.

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:45.190
I now end my turn!

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.320
It's my turn now.

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:51.290
I also summon Armor Canine — Cannonboxer!

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:58.810
Its effect lets me Special Summon 
Armor Canine — Bullcopter!

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:06.200
Bullcopter's effect lets me add 
Polymerization to my hand.

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:12.880
And I activate it, in order to fuse 
my two Armor Canines!

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:14.980
Fusion Summon!

00:17:15.310 --> 00:17:16.620
Appear...

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:19.450
Full Armor Canine — Bullfortress!

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:21.470
The same monster?

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:24.560
Then, he'll also send a Polymerization 
card to his graveyard.

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:27.770
Bullfortress lets me send Polymerization

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:31.660
or a card with "Fusion" in its name, 
from my hand to the graveyard,

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:33.900
to increase its attack points by 1000!

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:37.200
I send Polymerization and 
Re-Fusion to the graveyard,

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.130
to increase its attack points by 2000!

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:42.040
4000?

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:44.270
I end my turn.

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:46.780
My turn!

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:50.180
I also summon Cannonboxer.

00:17:54.350 --> 00:17:58.710
Its effect lets me Special Summon 
Armor Canine — Bullcopter!

00:18:00.940 --> 00:18:04.530
Bullcopter's effect lets me add 
Polymerization to my hand.

00:18:05.070 --> 00:18:08.860
And I activate it to fuse my two Armor Canines,

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:11.240
and Fusion Summon Armor Canine — Bullfortress!

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:14.670
Can it be... This time, he'll use three?

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:17.900
I send four cards, Polymerization, Re-Fusion,

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:21.650
Fusion Recovery, and Fusion 
Reserve, to my graveyard,

00:18:22.090 --> 00:18:25.620
to increase Bullfortress's 
attack points by 4000!

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:32.020
A-Attack points of 3000, 4000, and 6000?!

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:35.180
Now, there's nothing you can do!

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:37.470
You see the power of Academia?

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:41.000
Better surrender before you get hurt.

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:42.620
Surrender?

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:46.000
But the fight is just getting started.

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:47.620
My turn!

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:53.480
I activate my spell Machine 
Angel Ritual from my hand!

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:03.930
I tribute Level 4 Etoile Cyber, on my field,

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:08.330
and Level 6 Cyber Prima, in my hand, 
so I can Ritual Summon!

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:20.440
Angel of light with eternal power,

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:25.110
let your presence be known to the 
entire world, illuminating all creation!

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:32.480
Descend, Level 10 Cyber Angel Vrash!

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:39.020
She uses Ritual Summoning?

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:42.400
Summoning a Level 10 monster, just like that...

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:44.500
You're as impressive as we'd heard.

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:46.520
It has 3000 attack points.

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:51.100
With something like that, how do you 
expect to stand against our units?

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:52.680
You can't win.

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:55.210
This is the last day you'll defy Academia!

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.410
Are you sure about that?

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:01.950
When I successfully summon 
Cyber Angel Vrash,

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:05.620
I destroy all Fusion Monsters 
on your side of the field,

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:11.290
and for each, I deal their 
controllers 1000 damage!

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:12.330
What?

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:14.510
All our monsters...

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:15.260
Destroyed?

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:17.860
Ascension Burst!

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:35.280
Vrash can attack as many times as the 
number of monsters it destroyed.

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:37.050
It destroyed three monsters.

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:40.780
Thus, I can directly attack each of you once!

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:43.990
Go, Cyber Angel Vrash!

00:20:58.340 --> 00:20:59.630
Wow.

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:01.700
Come with me.

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:07.850
We can get around on this. Get on.

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:11.880
What's your name?

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:14.940
Yuzu. Yuzu Hiiragi.

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:15.850
And you?

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:17.680
I'm Asuka.

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:19.480
Asuka?

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:22.830
Yes, Asuka Tenjoin. Nice to meet you.

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:23.900
Yes!

00:21:35.670 --> 00:21:37.320
Come in, Yuzu.

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:42.640
Many students here have escaped 
from Academia, like you.

00:21:44.020 --> 00:21:45.180
Escaped?

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:48.420
My turn! Draw!

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:50.410
What is this place?

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:54.220
Our duel academy, the You Show School.

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:55.930
You Show School?!

00:21:56.370 --> 00:21:57.660
This way.

00:22:05.070 --> 00:22:07.040
A-Are you...

00:23:50.680 --> 00:23:54.340
You are Yusyo Sakaki's son?

00:23:54.340 --> 00:23:56.810
Do you know my father, too?

00:23:56.810 --> 00:23:59.660
Yes, I could never forget.

00:23:59.660 --> 00:24:01.040
This is a good chance.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:06.410
If you're Yusyo Sakaki's son, you will 
be good bait to lure him out.

00:24:06.410 --> 00:24:08.960
Tell me... What happened to my father?!

00:24:08.960 --> 00:24:10.360
No questions!

00:24:10.690 --> 00:24:14.960
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The HEROs Named "D."

00:24:14.960 --> 00:24:16.800
The fun is only getting started!
